                                "sense_id": "be969531-2a8a-390d-b425-3ac58b328a67",
                                "text": "The first kind of pseudomorphs, are pseudomorphs by alteration; the second, pseudomorphs by replacement; the third, pseudomorphs by infiltration; the fourth, pseudomorphs by incrustation."
